{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の乃木どこ見てもらえましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「制服のマネキン」のヒット祈願のため"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"御百度参りと滝行をしてきました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーはあみあみ・まなっちゃん・れなりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜辛かったぁぁ(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"御百度参りは、裸足で冷たい地面の上を108回往復。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初のうちは冷たすぎるし「あと何回？」ってくじけそうになっちゃったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中からなんだか分からないけど不思議なパワーがみなぎって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「これが修行か...」って感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走ってる前半と後半のみんなの顔を比べてみてもらえたらわかるかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滝行は、必死すぎてよくわからない状態でした(ノ><)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく怖かったし冷たかったーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもとにかくみんなで声をかけあってやりきりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も支えられて絆が深まったし、精神も鍛えられたと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんとは口が回らなかったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一生懸命「ヒットしますように」ってお願いもしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は水チームでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山・崖・火チームも過酷な中で頑張りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから「制服のマネキン」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方の手に渡るとうれしいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ明日発売o(^-^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワクワクしますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/18/1678471/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日21時からの火曜曲に出演します。ぜひ見てください♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「制服のマネキン」の着うた先行配信が本日までとなりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レコチョクさんで購入いただいた方は素敵なプレゼントがありますので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非チェックしてみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イチオシで展開してもらってますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは公式HPで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダウンロードはこちら\nhttp://recochoku.jp/artist/30168093/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/www/news/assets_c/2012/11/QRcode.gif-thumb-100x100-2482.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}